WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:06.260
In some ways, now I can look back on it, it was humiliating for the blacks.

2
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:13.660
Because you get on the bus and you paid what everybody else paid, but you couldn’t sit where everybody else would sit.

3
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.380
There was a divided section.

4
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.860
You would go to that section and sit on the bus.

5
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:22.280
If you sat anywhere else, you were asked to go to the back of the bus.

6
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.640
And it was known in that time that blacks did not sit in the front of the bus.
